{"id":"c6e69f0f07e062bc","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-consistency-modal.md","title":"Consistency (Modal)","display":"df-consistency-modal — Consistency (Modal)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-consistency-modal","aliases":["89-df-consistency-modal"],"display":"df-consistency-modal — Consistency (Modal)","depends_on":["[[89-df-box-modality]]","[[89-df-modal-negation]]","[[89-df-modal-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-consistency-modal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-consistency-modal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-consistency-modal — Consistency (Modal)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d246470e97fec132\" href=\"?note=d246470e97fec132\" title=\"89-df-box-modality\">89-df-box-modality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5dbb49ee42ea9770\" href=\"?note=5dbb49ee42ea9770\" title=\"89-df-modal-negation\">89-df-modal-negation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> is the falsum formula.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\Box:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> is the box constructor.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}^{\\Box}\n\\coloneqq\n\\neg\\Box\\bot,\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Con}^{\\Box}\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}^{\\Box}\n\\coloneqq\n\\neg\\Box\\bot,\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Con}^{\\Box}\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}^{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}^{\\Box}\\)</span> : the modal consistency formula</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> : 矛盾/恒假</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\Box\\bot\">\\(\\neg\\Box\\bot\\)</span> : &quot;矛盾不可证&quot;</li>\n<li>Löb 模式取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\bot\">\\(A=\\bot\\)</span> 给出\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\vdash\\Box\\mathrm{Con}^{\\Box}\\to\\neg\\mathrm{Con}^{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\vdash\\Box\\mathrm{Con}^{\\Box}\\to\\neg\\mathrm{Con}^{\\Box}\\)</span>；\n等价地，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}^{\\Box}\\to\\neg\\Box\\mathrm{Con}^{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}^{\\Box}\\to\\neg\\Box\\mathrm{Con}^{\\Box}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>第二不完备性的模态对应还包括\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}^{\\Box}\\notin\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}^{\\Box}\\notin\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span>；这些是后续定理，而非本定义的一部分。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-box-modality","status":"resolved","id":"d246470e97fec132","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-box-modality]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-negation","status":"resolved","id":"5dbb49ee42ea9770","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-negation]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\bot\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}^{\\Box}\n\\coloneqq\n\\neg\\Box\\bot,\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Con}^{\\Box}\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}^{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\Box\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"A=\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}\\vdash\\Box\\mathrm{Con}^{\\Box}\\to\\neg\\mathrm{Con}^{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}^{\\Box}\\to\\neg\\Box\\mathrm{Con}^{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}^{\\Box}\\notin\\mathrm{GL}","display":false}],"bytes":1148,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-248","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-consistency-modal]]"}],"outgoing":["d246470e97fec132","5dbb49ee42ea9770","56c1b5b75a32ca1d"]}